            <li>Delhi — Delhi Police Constable, DSSSB posts</li>
            <li>Maharashtra, Gujarat, Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, West Bengal — State Police Constable recruitments</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Department-wise 12th Pass Govt Jobs</h2>
